title: "SemanticDrift: How Rewording Tool Descriptions Changes Agent Benchmark Evidence"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-06-29
url: "https://github.com/Mukkandi-Sridhar/SemanticDrift"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mukkandi-Sridhar/SemanticDrift"
abstract: >
  Code, data and results for a pre-registered study of how rewriting the descriptions of MCP
  tools affects tool selection by LLM agents. Using the 36 MCP tools of IBM AssetOpsBench,
  152 requests, nine description catalogs (including earlier descriptions recovered from the
  benchmark's git history) and ten models, it reports 38,304 decisions: aggregate accuracy is
  stable, but model rankings, individual decisions and safety-relevant write actions change.
